WEBVTT

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:11.670
She's lost a lot of blood, but her
external injuries aren't too serious.

00:00:11.760 --> 00:00:14.630
The problem is inside her body.

00:00:14.720 --> 00:00:20.060
Frankly put, things aren't right.
What exactly happened to her?

00:00:22.270 --> 00:00:25.020
Sorry. That's...

00:00:27.270 --> 00:00:29.230
Can't say, huh?

00:00:30.480 --> 00:00:33.440
Well, I figured as much.

00:00:35.110 --> 00:00:37.660
But at this rate, she won't have long to live!

00:02:10.750 --> 00:02:15.710
"Vow"

00:02:24.890 --> 00:02:26.100
Takayama-san!

00:02:26.180 --> 00:02:28.890
Is Mom... Is Mom all right?!

00:02:30.690 --> 00:02:34.980
Yeah. She's just a little exhausted from work.

00:02:35.070 --> 00:02:37.940
Some rest, and she'll be all better.

00:02:38.030 --> 00:02:41.570
Really? What a relief...

00:02:43.160 --> 00:02:44.410
Takayama-san!

00:02:44.490 --> 00:02:47.660
Amaha-san is awake!

00:02:47.750 --> 00:02:51.960
Really?!
Yes. But...

00:02:53.040 --> 00:02:54.380
You're going home?!

00:02:54.460 --> 00:02:55.840
Yeah.

00:02:55.920 --> 00:03:01.220
I'm sorry I worried you, Riko!
I'm all better now, though!

00:03:01.300 --> 00:03:03.760
Really? You're not pushing yourself?

00:03:03.850 --> 00:03:06.100
Nope, not a bit!

00:03:06.180 --> 00:03:09.850
You're such a worrywart, Riko!

00:03:09.930 --> 00:03:12.480
Go wait in the car, okay?
Okay!

00:03:20.650 --> 00:03:25.570
Are you
That was sooner than expected...

00:03:27.450 --> 00:03:29.370
When did it start?

00:03:29.450 --> 00:03:34.880
The other day... After I
fought by your villa, I guess.

00:03:34.960 --> 00:03:36.710
Why didn't you say anything?!

00:03:39.920 --> 00:03:43.930
You can't yet! You need complete bed rest!

00:03:44.010 --> 00:03:49.010
If all I'm gonna do is sleep, I can
do it anywhere, not just the hospital!

00:03:49.100 --> 00:03:49.850
Masane!

00:03:49.890 --> 00:03:53.890
I want to go home. To our home.

00:03:58.190 --> 00:04:00.190
You failed?!

00:04:00.280 --> 00:04:02.690
Could you please not yell like that?

00:04:02.780 --> 00:04:05.490
I even supplied you with one of our I-Weapons!

00:04:05.570 --> 00:04:09.740
Do you expect me to say, "Oh, okay!"
after hearing it's been crushed?!

00:04:09.830 --> 00:04:15.580
It wasn't for naught. I did manage
to recover data on the Witchblade.

00:04:15.670 --> 00:04:19.000
Individually, it couldn't
stand up to its power,

00:04:19.090 --> 00:04:21.920
but in numbers, there's no question
they could seize the Witchblade.

00:04:22.010 --> 00:04:26.130
Then why couldn't you have sent
multiple units in the first place?!

00:04:26.220 --> 00:04:30.760
You know it's impossible to prepare
many in such a short time frame!

00:04:30.850 --> 00:04:33.180
We're not magicians, you know!

00:04:36.060 --> 00:04:39.150
The IU-Weapons are progressing here.

00:04:39.230 --> 00:04:42.150
You take care of your own work.

00:04:42.240 --> 00:04:45.570
Yeah. All right.

00:04:45.660 --> 00:04:48.820
Leave the groundwork for the
various government sectors to me.

00:04:48.910 --> 00:04:52.910
But any further failure will not be tolerated!

00:04:53.000 --> 00:04:54.540
I know.

00:04:54.620 --> 00:04:55.910
Yes. Goodbye.

00:05:01.670 --> 00:05:06.010
How I long for a world where
I can immerse myself in research...

00:05:06.090 --> 00:05:09.090
There is nothing as worthy of research as this.

00:05:10.390 --> 00:05:14.850
You fainted from anemia?
Are you okay, Masamune-Chan?!

00:05:14.930 --> 00:05:19.440
Honestly! It's because you work too much!

00:05:19.520 --> 00:05:22.190
Sorry to worry you...

00:05:22.280 --> 00:05:25.240
Mom, are you really all right?

00:05:25.320 --> 00:05:31.870
I'm fine! With lots of food and
rest, I'll be better in no time!

00:05:31.950 --> 00:05:32.830
Really?

00:05:32.910 --> 00:05:37.790
In that case, let's make
an incredible meal for Masamune-Chan!

00:05:37.870 --> 00:05:40.040
Yay! I can't wait!

00:05:40.130 --> 00:05:42.960
Everybody! Let's get to it!

00:05:44.670 --> 00:05:46.210
Hey, you.

00:05:49.680 --> 00:05:53.890
Does she... really only have anemia?

00:05:56.270 --> 00:05:57.230
Hey!

00:05:58.640 --> 00:06:00.940
Answer me! Hey!

00:06:03.020 --> 00:06:08.610
Liver's the best for anemia!
It's great at recovering stamina, too!

00:06:08.700 --> 00:06:13.580
Hmm, but Mom hates liver...

00:06:13.660 --> 00:06:18.540
What if we deep-fried it tatsuta style?
She likes fried stuff, right?

00:06:18.620 --> 00:06:19.870
Yeah!

00:06:50.490 --> 00:06:52.860
"Rihoko & Masane"

00:07:07.380 --> 00:07:08.340
No...

00:07:10.760 --> 00:07:14.590
I... don't want to die yet!

00:07:14.680 --> 00:07:17.640
No... Not yet!

00:07:20.020 --> 00:07:26.310
If I die, I'll never get
to be with Riko again...

00:07:40.750 --> 00:07:46.500
What's a retired official doing
at a Douji lab at this point?

00:07:51.170 --> 00:07:53.930
I smell a major story.

00:07:54.010 --> 00:07:58.600
Maybe it's a hunch?
Mine are often right, you see...

00:07:59.890 --> 00:08:05.810
I'm here for a personal reason.
Nothing that would be of interest to you.

00:08:05.900 --> 00:08:07.860
Personal reason?

00:08:15.990 --> 00:08:18.070
Is it related to Masamune?

00:08:26.500 --> 00:08:31.880
Let me in, too!
Or else I'll shout for security guards!

00:08:31.960 --> 00:08:35.090
I'm running low on time. Do as you wish.

00:08:48.730 --> 00:08:51.320
No cameras.

00:08:51.400 --> 00:08:52.570
'Kay...

00:08:55.280 --> 00:08:58.910
Seriously, what're you doing here?

00:08:58.990 --> 00:09:00.830
You've cut all ties with Douji, right?

00:09:00.910 --> 00:09:06.960
I have. But all our
research data is stored here.

00:09:07.040 --> 00:09:08.960
Research data?

00:09:09.040 --> 00:09:12.880
Data about the Witchblade and its wearers.

00:09:15.260 --> 00:09:18.050
Does the fact you've come to get it...

00:09:18.140 --> 00:09:21.300
...mean something has happened to Masamune?!

00:09:42.620 --> 00:09:47.160
Talk about super-strict. I thought
this was just a research facility?

00:09:49.960 --> 00:09:50.960
Who's there?!

00:09:54.420 --> 00:09:56.170
Director Takayama?!

00:09:58.720 --> 00:10:02.970
My former staff members.
Members who shouldn't be here, either.

00:10:03.060 --> 00:10:04.390
Huh?

00:10:04.470 --> 00:10:07.850
Douji laid you all off. What're you doing here?

00:10:07.940 --> 00:10:09.890
Something's come up.

00:10:09.980 --> 00:10:13.440
We received an SOS...

00:10:13.520 --> 00:10:14.860
SOS?

00:10:19.910 --> 00:10:21.360
Director Takayama!

00:10:21.450 --> 00:10:23.990
What's happened?!
Have a look at this.

00:10:25.040 --> 00:10:28.750
The I-Weapons we rolled out
last month to be sent to Baradhi...

00:10:28.830 --> 00:10:32.210
...have started to act
strangely all of a sudden.

00:10:32.290 --> 00:10:35.550
They were in dead-stop mode,
but then they'd automatically boot up,

00:10:35.630 --> 00:10:39.550
reacting to commands that were
never given, and malfunction.

00:10:39.630 --> 00:10:45.010
We requested a recall of all shipped
units so that we could investigate,

00:10:45.100 --> 00:10:47.850
but the higher-ups refuse to listen to us.

00:10:47.930 --> 00:10:49.890
Wadou, huh...

00:10:49.980 --> 00:10:50.940
Yes.

00:10:51.020 --> 00:10:57.230
Since our hands were tied,
we decided to secretly call Ota-san's team.

00:10:57.320 --> 00:10:59.610
How many are in storage here?

00:10:59.700 --> 00:11:01.070
300 units.

00:11:02.410 --> 00:11:07.330
There's that many I-Weapons sitting here,
just waiting to malfunction?!

00:11:07.410 --> 00:11:09.200
When did the phenomenon start?

00:11:09.290 --> 00:11:12.580
Just recently. Two days ago, I'd say.

00:11:12.670 --> 00:11:16.090
But it was yesterday they
started to really go haywire.

00:11:16.170 --> 00:11:18.840
Around 5:00 in the evening, I'd say.

00:11:18.920 --> 00:11:20.670
What is it?!

00:11:20.760 --> 00:11:25.970
The Witchblade. The Witchblade
was in combat mode at those times!

00:11:26.060 --> 00:11:29.680
That can't be! The I-Weapons
have safeguards in place...

00:11:29.770 --> 00:11:31.810
...to prevent them from
reacting to the Witchblade!

00:11:31.890 --> 00:11:35.360
To the earlier Witchblade, you mean.

00:11:35.440 --> 00:11:39.860
It appears we need to update the data on it.

00:11:48.080 --> 00:11:53.250
Honestly! Buying all this!
Don't blame me if there's any left over!

00:11:53.330 --> 00:11:55.630
Knowing Mom, she'll scarf it all down!

00:11:55.710 --> 00:11:58.920
When she's hungry, there's no stopping her!

00:11:59.000 --> 00:12:02.720
All right! I'm gonna work hard for you, Mom!

00:12:05.140 --> 00:12:08.810
The Witchblade and the I-Weapons
are undeniably connected.

00:12:08.890 --> 00:12:11.930
I guess it's because they're
drawn to immense energy.

00:12:12.020 --> 00:12:13.440
Hold on a sec!

00:12:13.520 --> 00:12:16.810
Do you mean all these things
are gonna go after Masamune?!

00:12:16.900 --> 00:12:19.770
Yes... Pretty much.

00:12:19.860 --> 00:12:22.570
Could I see the PC?

00:12:22.650 --> 00:12:24.610
There's data I want to check.

00:12:39.300 --> 00:12:40.880
This damn thing!

00:12:42.340 --> 00:12:44.260
If it weren't

00:12:44.340 --> 00:12:49.890
If it weren't for this, both Riko and I could

00:13:54.080 --> 00:13:58.000
Why me?!

00:13:58.080 --> 00:14:00.380
Why Riko?!

00:14:00.460 --> 00:14:04.050
Why?!

00:14:05.920 --> 00:14:10.390
Neither of us asked for this power!

00:14:10.470 --> 00:14:15.970
So why?! Why?!

00:14:25.730 --> 00:14:29.650
Hey. She doesn't have simple anemia, does she?

00:14:29.740 --> 00:14:34.870
The Witchblade's excessive
power is eating away at her body.

00:14:34.950 --> 00:14:37.700
At this rate, she's going to die soon.

00:14:42.960 --> 00:14:45.040
S-So that's...

00:14:45.130 --> 00:14:50.930
B-But she can get better, right?!
That's why you're checking this data?

00:14:51.010 --> 00:14:53.680
The data Sohou Reina left behind...

00:14:53.760 --> 00:14:57.890
I had a look at her observational
records provided by the NSWF,

00:14:59.890 --> 00:15:05.570
but I can find no way to prevent
Witchblade-induced breakdowns.

00:15:06.940 --> 00:15:08.990
Then what happens to Masamune?!

00:15:11.280 --> 00:15:12.200
Hey!

00:15:12.280 --> 00:15:18.240
C-Can't you take it off?!
Can't you just take the Witchblade off her?!

00:15:20.000 --> 00:15:23.630
That is exactly what is impossible.

00:15:27.130 --> 00:15:31.300
The only way to escape the
Witchblade... is through death.

00:15:34.350 --> 00:15:36.300
What the hell?

00:15:38.020 --> 00:15:41.230
What the hell is the Witchblade?!

00:15:41.310 --> 00:15:46.860
She never wanted to fight!
She just wanted to keep Rihoko safe...

00:15:47.940 --> 00:15:53.030
Yet, you guys twist her
around your little finger,

00:15:53.110 --> 00:15:57.280
run her ragged, and
then this is what she gets?!

00:15:59.580 --> 00:16:03.830
Hundreds of I-Weapons are gonna
go berserk and go after her?!

00:16:03.920 --> 00:16:08.000
She never wanted that!

00:16:08.090 --> 00:16:15.640
Wanted or not, this is the fate
of those chosen by the Witchblade.

00:16:15.720 --> 00:16:17.970
They attract fights, and die in fights.

00:16:18.060 --> 00:16:20.890
Damn you!

00:16:20.980 --> 00:16:25.940
All I can do is support her until the end!

00:16:28.270 --> 00:16:32.030
It has been determined that the fighting
in the Bay Area the other day...

00:16:32.110 --> 00:16:34.030
...was caused by remnants of the X-Cons.

00:16:34.110 --> 00:16:37.780
I thought all the X-Cons had been disposed of?!

00:16:37.870 --> 00:16:40.200
I can't believe some survived...

00:16:40.290 --> 00:16:45.370
To let the public know that Douji
intends to take full responsibility,

00:16:45.460 --> 00:16:50.840
I feel we must work with the
government to exterminate the X-Cons.

00:16:50.920 --> 00:16:55.880
I ask for negotiations with
all levels of the government.

00:16:55.970 --> 00:16:58.760
What brilliant thinking!

00:16:58.850 --> 00:17:03.140
Now we can capture the Witchblade
in the city, out in the open!

00:17:03.230 --> 00:17:06.640
Just brilliant, Wadou-san! As they say,
a wise man profits from his

00:17:06.730 --> 00:17:08.270
Shut up! You're annoying!

00:17:11.070 --> 00:17:12.150
Aoi.

00:17:12.230 --> 00:17:16.320
Go to the Neo-Gene training center
and find the most skilled Sisters.

00:17:16.410 --> 00:17:19.450
Yes. How many do you need?

00:17:19.530 --> 00:17:24.000
One is enough.
Having many will only slow me down.

00:17:38.550 --> 00:17:39.930
Maria-sama?

00:17:46.190 --> 00:17:48.850
What's wrong, Maria-sama?

00:17:50.480 --> 00:17:52.900
It's nothing.

00:17:52.980 --> 00:17:55.530
I'm going to obtain power...

00:17:57.400 --> 00:18:03.370
I'm going to obtain the Witchblade...
The power to have everything...

00:18:08.920 --> 00:18:12.460
You're going to kill me.

00:18:12.540 --> 00:18:16.050
Even after I die, you'll still be here.

00:18:16.130 --> 00:18:20.220
And then you'll do to Rihoko
what you've done to me...

00:18:20.300 --> 00:18:23.260
No! I refuse to let you!

00:18:31.900 --> 00:18:37.860
I'm going to die. But I'm going to take you...

00:18:37.950 --> 00:18:40.360
...with me...

00:18:40.450 --> 00:18:41.860
...to Hell!

00:18:55.000 --> 00:18:58.590
I'm going to stay here and
take care of the I-Weapons.

00:18:58.670 --> 00:19:02.010
There's no way to tell what's going
on without detailed analysis, but...

00:19:02.090 --> 00:19:06.890
Hundreds of I-Weapons going berserk...
That's some serious stuff.

00:19:06.970 --> 00:19:11.060
I'm going to work to
prevent that from happening.

00:19:11.150 --> 00:19:14.190
During that time...

00:19:14.270 --> 00:19:16.320
...I leave Masane and Rihoko in your hands!

00:19:19.650 --> 00:19:21.780
Oh, Tozawa-Chan! Welcome back!

00:19:21.860 --> 00:19:22.740
Yeah.

00:19:22.820 --> 00:19:28.080
Hey, kiddo! Food's waitin'!
Michael! Could you get a plate?

00:19:30.080 --> 00:19:34.830
Delicious! Your food's definitely
the best in the world, Riko!

00:19:38.670 --> 00:19:43.180
You get better so quickly, Masamune-Chan!

00:19:43.260 --> 00:19:45.970
Is it good? Is it good?
Yeah! It's great!

00:19:46.050 --> 00:19:46.850
Isn't it, though?!

00:19:46.930 --> 00:19:49.680
We made some for you too,
Tozawa-Chan! Here you go!

00:19:49.770 --> 00:19:51.890
What're you just standing there for?

00:19:51.980 --> 00:19:55.400
Join in quick, before Masane eats it all!

00:19:55.480 --> 00:19:57.020
Oh, right.

00:20:01.820 --> 00:20:02.990
Where's Takayama?

00:20:03.070 --> 00:20:06.950
Yeah, uhh... He went back to a Douji lab.

00:20:07.030 --> 00:20:09.830
Douji? What for?

00:20:09.910 --> 00:20:12.870
Well, some stuff came up.

00:20:15.670 --> 00:20:17.880
So, umm...

00:20:20.760 --> 00:20:25.510
What's wrong, Tozawa-Chan?
Did you eat on your way here?

00:20:25.590 --> 00:20:27.550
No, I'll eat. Yeah.

00:20:32.980 --> 00:20:35.560
Hey! Take some pictures!

00:20:35.650 --> 00:20:37.100
What brought that on?

00:20:37.190 --> 00:20:41.940
Everyone worked hard to make all this!
We gotta commemorate it!

00:20:42.030 --> 00:20:43.440
Great idea!

00:20:43.530 --> 00:20:48.870
Let's put the "Rihoko-Chan and Chou-san
special salad" in the center!

00:20:49.910 --> 00:20:52.080
Riko! Over here!

00:20:53.540 --> 00:20:54.710
Come up!

00:21:08.850 --> 00:21:12.270
Oh, all right. Line up, everyone!

00:21:27.070 --> 00:21:29.990
Dammit... I can't focus...

00:21:33.120 --> 00:21:35.540
Okay! One more!

00:21:35.620 --> 00:21:36.580
'Kay!

00:21:46.790 --> 00:21:54.740
I turn around half-asleep as my hits the right side of my cheek

00:21:54.740 --> 00:22:02.990
Your voice was there, and the air was warm

00:22:02.990 --> 00:22:11.260
Your right hand grazes my left shoulder

00:22:11.260 --> 00:22:15.730
But why don't you hold on tight?

00:22:20.340 --> 00:22:28.500
In order to change yesterday's wish tomorrow,

00:22:28.500 --> 00:22:35.690
I need to grow stronger myself

00:22:36.920 --> 00:22:44.840
Even now, I am breathing in your scent, ...

00:22:44.840 --> 00:22:53.510
and jumping over to your side. Give me your love.

00:22:55.180 --> 00:23:02.990
Extend your hands. Reach them out to me.

00:23:02.990 --> 00:23:09.540
I'm so happy

00:23:11.970 --> 00:23:15.260
That was fun, Riko!
We haven't had a party in a while!

00:23:15.350 --> 00:23:18.680
And Tozawa-chan took lots of pictures for us!

00:23:18.770 --> 00:23:20.810
Let's put some in the
kitchen when they're done!

00:23:20.890 --> 00:23:26.360
I like being with you, Riko!
I really, really like it!

00:23:26.440 --> 00:23:28.730
I want to always see your face!

00:23:28.820 --> 00:23:32.280
Not when you're crying; when you're smiling.

00:23:32.360 --> 00:23:35.450
I want you to always be able to smile.

00:23:35.530 --> 00:23:38.870
That's the only thing I wish for now.
